{
    "chapter_num": 3,
    "verses_count": 15,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Maintain Good Deeds"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Remind them to be submissive to rulers and authorities, to be obedient, to be ready for any honest work, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "to speak evil of no one, to avoid quarreling, to be gentle, and to show perfect courtesy toward all men. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For we ourselves were once foolish, disobedient, led astray, slaves to various passions and pleasures, passing our days in malice and envy, hated by men and hating one another; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "but when the goodness and loving kindness of God our Savior appeared, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "he saved us, not because of deeds done by us in righteousness, but in virtue of his own mercy, by the washing of regeneration and renewal in the Holy Spirit, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "which he poured out upon us richly through Jesus Christ our Savior, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "so that we might be justified by his grace and become heirs in hope of eternal life. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The saying is sure."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "I desire you to insist on these things, so that those who have believed in God may be careful to apply themselves to good deeds;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or enter honorable occupations"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " these are excellent and profitable to men. "
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But avoid stupid controversies, genealogies, dissensions, and quarrels over the law, for they are unprofitable and futile. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "As for a man who is factious, after admonishing him once or twice, have nothing more to do with him, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "knowing that such a person is perverted and sinful; he is self-condemned."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Final Messages and Benediction"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "When I send Artemas or Tych′icus to you, do your best to come to me at Nicop′olis, for I have decided to spend the winter there. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Do your best to speed Zenas the lawyer and Apol′los on their way; see that they lack nothing. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And let our people learn to apply themselves to good deeds,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or enter honorable occupations"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " so as to help cases of urgent need, and not to be unfruitful."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "All who are with me send greetings to you. Greet those who love us in the faith."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Grace be with you all."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}